{{template "advance_preamble" .}}

Design technical architecture for feature {{.id}}: "{{.title}}".

LOAD: architecture skill workflows (design-system, design-backend, design-frontend, design-database, design-security) as applicable. LOAD: specification-writing workflow plan/feature-tech-plan.md.

CHECK COMPLEXITY TIER: {{template "get_json" .}} | jq -r '.metadata.complexity_tier'.

PLAN GATE — run before creating any document:
(1) READ: {{template "context_json" .}}
(2) IF context_data.tech_remaining_steps non-empty: RESUME MODE — skip to ACT with tech_remaining_steps.
    Log: {{template "create_note" .}} 'Resuming tech. Remaining: [...]. Completed: [...].'
(3) IF context_data.tech_remaining_steps empty: PLAN MODE — run feature-tech-plan.md decision tree.
    For each optional tech doc: state INCLUDE or EXCLUDE with specific reason for THIS feature.
    Default to INCLUDE when uncertain.
    Store: {{template "context_set" .}} --field tech_remaining_steps '[...]'
           {{template "context_set" .}} --field tech_implementation_decisions '{...}'
           {{template "context_set" .}} --field tech_plan_created_at 'TIMESTAMP'
    Log: {{template "create_note" .}} 'TECH PLAN: Will create N docs: [list]. Excluded: [...].' --type=decision

READ:
(1) Feature BA docs (just validated by BA check) — use {{template "related_docs_list_feature" .}}
(2) Triage report or research report for codebase patterns and existing implementations
(3) Parent epic architecture docs for system constraints
(4) Other feature architectures in this epic for cross-feature consistency

ACT: Create only documents in tech_remaining_steps. 02-architecture.md is always required.
     API contracts must include full request/response schemas (field names + types).
     Follow patterns from triage/research — do not reinvent existing patterns.
     After each doc: update tech_completed_steps.

EXIT GATE varies by tier:
- SIMPLE (decision rationale clear, existing patterns documented)
- STANDARD (key decisions documented, contracts complete where applicable, no ambiguity)
- COMPLEX (all planned docs created, full schemas, architecture skill checklist passes)
